<title>USA: New York physical copper market - May 1.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market - May 1.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for May shipment were quoted at a nominal 113.65 to 113.90 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 91.50 cents, down 0.50 cents from April 30th.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
